|content2=
*April 3rd - '''AVANGAR''' announce that [[Jame]] will be going inactive for an unspecified amount of time. He is replaced on the active lineup by [[Ramz1k]]. <ref name="ramz1k">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Avangargaming/status/981163675460386818|title=Всем привет многие конечно уже увидели новость о замене в нашем CS:GO составе...|trans_title=Hello all many of course have already seen the news of the replacement in our CS: GO lineup...|date=2018-04-03|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|publisher='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*May 11th - [[Jame]] returns to active lineup. <ref name="Jame returns">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-143377380_7302|title=Вернулся в avangar.|trans_title=Returned in Avangard.|date=2018-04-03|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|publisher=[[Jame]]}}</ref> [[Ramz1k]] released. <ref name="Ramz1k leaves">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-143377380_7302|title=spasibo za poderjky.|trans_title=Thanks for supporting me|date=2018-04-03|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|publisher=[[Ramz1k]]}}</ref>
*July 19th - [[fitch]] replaces [[dimasick]]; the latter is put on the transfer list. <ref name="fitch joins">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-101641627_37223|title=Изменения в составе|trans_title=Changes in the composition|date=2018-07-19|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|publisher='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*November 6th - '''[[Gambit Esports]]''' sign [[dimasick]]. <ref name="dimasick leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1059740023631831041|title=Today we announce that dimasick leaves our organization and he's transferred to Gambit Esports|publisher='''AVANGAR'''|date=2018-11-06}}</ref>

|content3=
*March 18th - [[KrizzeN]] steps down from the active roster indefinitely due to health issues, [[SANJI]] will stand-in. <ref name="KrizzeN health">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1107622613835227136|title=AVANGAR CS:GO roster update|date=2019-03-18|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*April 12th - '''AVANGAR''' sign [[SANJI]] after 1 month substitute period. <ref name="SANJI joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1116672344603410432|title=Today we’d like to welcome SANJI as our #CSGO roster starting 5th.|date=2019-04-12|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*June 24th - [[fitch]] is transfer listed. <ref name="fitch transfer listed">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1143162343242776577|title=CS:GO ROSTER UPDATE|date=2019-06-24|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*June 25th - '''AVANGAR''' sign [[AdreN (Kazakh player)|AdreN]]. <ref name="AdreN joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1143504297633751045|title=Пятый игрок уже здесь! Добро пожаловать, AdreN|trans_title=Our fifth player is already here! Welcome, AdreN!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2019-06-25|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*July 31st - [[fitch]] is released. <ref name="fitch released">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1156550075423834112|title=Starting today, July 31st, fitch becomes the free agent|date=2019-07-31|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*October 7th - [[Winstrike Team]] acquire [[KrizzeN]] from '''AVANGAR'''. <ref name="krizzen leaves">{{cite web|url=https://team.winstrike.gg/en/troe-novyh-igrokov-v-cs-go-sostave-winstrike-team/|title=Three new CS:GO players in the Winstrike team roster|date=2019-10-07|author=[[Winstrike Team]]}}</ref>
*December 16th - [[Virtus.pro]] acquire '''AVANGAR'''<nowiki>'s</nowiki> roster. <ref name="avg to vp">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/new-cs-go-roster|title=New CS:GO roster|date=2019-12-16|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>

|content4=
*February 13th - '''AVANGAR''' transition [[AVANGAR Q]] into being the organization's main squad. <ref name="avangar q became main">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1227950285982707718|title=It's been 2 weeks since we announced our new CS:GO roster — these boys have received a huge amount of support despite not being a roster with authentic name.|date=2020-02-13|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*March 16th - '''AVANGAR''' part ways with [[lmbt]]. <ref name="lmbt leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1239592792969687042|title=Today we’re announcing @LMBT_CSGO departure from AVANGAR CS:GO Coach position as his 2-month contract expires.|date=2020-03-16|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*April 1st - '''AVANGAR''' cease operations and release their team. <ref name="ceases operations">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1245244912318152705|title=AVANGAR cease operations|date=2020-04-01|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>

|content5=
*November 29th - '''AVANGAR''' announce their return to ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with the signings of [[FinigaN]], [[znxxX]], [[kade0]], [[s1natoRRR]], [[ICY]], and [[malinger]] as coach. <ref name="AVANGAR 2021">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1465244257653071876|title=We promised you'll see us around|date=2021-11-29|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>

|content6=
*January 29th - '''AVANGAR''' part ways with [[znxxX]] and add [[fozil]] and [[enzero]] on trial. <ref name="fozil trial">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1487395578971660289|title=The offseason had an impact on our CS:GO roster|date=2022-01-29|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*July 18th - [[AdreN (Kazakh player)|AdreN]] rejoins the organization as a board member. <ref name="AdreN board member">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1548955809723432962|title=Welcome back @AdreNcs, AVANGAR’s newest Board Member|date=2022-07-18|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*July 20th - '''AVANGAR''' part ways with [[FinigaN]], [[fozil]], [[enzero]] and acquire [[sorrow]], [[w1nt3r]], and [[ice]] from [[Team Unique]]. <ref name="-Ffe">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1549725849091555329|title=AVANGAR CS:GO roster update|date=2022-07-20|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref><ref name="+swi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1549725851255816192|title=These boys have many victories ahead, and we’d like to wish them luck claiming them|date=2022-07-20|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>

|content7=
*February 6th - '''AVANGAR''' part ways with [[kade0]], [[sorrow]] and [[ice]] as they sign [[TNDKingg]], [[def1zer]], [[BLVCKM4GIC]] and [[Pumpkin66]], with the latter joining as a stand-in. <ref name="Feb 23">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1622566432213983232|title=Meet our 2023 Counter-Strike Lineup|date=2023-02-06|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*December 20th - '''AVANGAR''' bench [[ICY]] and add [[tasman]] as a stand-in. <ref name="Dec 23">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1737407130557100072|title=The AVANGAR Counter-Strike lineup for 2024|date=2023-12-20|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*December 28th - [[ICY]] is acquired by [[AMKAL ESPORTS]]. <ref name="amkal">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/amkalesports/status/1740442057313780199|title=Meet AMKAL ESPORTS|date=2023-12-28|author=[[AMKAL ESPORTS]]}}</ref>

|content8=
*January 24th - '''AVANGAR''' sign [[tasman]]. <ref name="+tasman">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/avangarkz/status/1750200672383812035|title=Welcome to the team TASMAN|date=2024-01-24|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*April 14th - '''AVANGAR''' cease operations and transfer-list their lineup. <ref name="2024 disband">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-101641627_143084|title=Важное объявление для наших болельщиков!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Important announcement for our fans!|date=2024-04-14|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*April 24th - '''AVANGAR''' release [[TNDKingg]], [[def1zer]], [[BLVCKM4GIC]], and [[Pumpkin66]]. <ref name="apr24 -4">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-101641627_143108|title=Важное объявление для наших болельщиков!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Important announcement for our fans!|date=2024-04-24|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
*May 6th - '''AVANGAR''' release [[tasman]]. <ref name="-tasman">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-101641627_143115|title=Важное объявление для наших болельщиков!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Important announcement for our fans!|date=2024-05-06|author='''AVANGAR'''}}</ref>
